{"id":"ra_pidamente","lemma":"rápidamente","pos":"adv","rank":1408,"glosses":["rapidly, quickly"],"ipa":"/ˌrapidaˈmente/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/13/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-r%C3%A1pidamente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Haz tu trabajo rápidamente.","en":"Do your work quickly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800858","words":[{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"work, job"},null]},{"text":"Un caballo corre rápidamente.","en":"A horse runs quickly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/937803","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"horse"},{"g":"to run, to jog","l":"correr"},null]},{"text":"Cierra la puerta rápidamente.","en":"Shut the door quickly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/462036","words":[{"g":"to close, to shut","l":"cerrar"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"door"},null]},{"text":"La moda cambia rápidamente.","en":"Fashions change quickly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460794","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"fashion"},{"g":"to change","l":"cambiar"},null]},{"text":"Él se decidió rápidamente.","en":"He made up his mind quickly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/330691","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to decide","l":"decidir"},null]}]}